flowchart TD
    A[Cyber event or service disruption] --> B[Assess severity, scope, trajectory]
    B --> C{Crisis trigger?}
    C -- No --> D[Incident response governance]
    C -- Yes --> E[Activate crisis structure; notify executives]
    E --> F[Set objectives, cadence, decision owners]
    F --> G[Coordinate containment, continuity, communications]
    G --> H[Assess recovery and residual risk]
    H --> I[Executive stand-down decision]
    I --> J[Post-incident review and action tracking]
